                </p></li><li class="c-article-references__item js-c-reading-companion-references-item" data-counter="6."><p class="c-article-references__text" id="ref-CR6">Asua JM (1997) Polymeric dispersions: principles and applications. Springer Netherlands, Dordrecht</p></li><li class="c-article-references__item js-c-reading-companion-references-item" data-counter="7."><p class="c-article-references__text" id="ref-CR7">Fang C, Zhou F, Zhu X (2021) The application research of benzyl methacrylate (BzMA) in acrylate latex pressure sensitive adhesives. Int J Adhes Adhes 107:102861. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijadhadh.2021.102861" data-track="click_references" data-track-action="external reference" data-track-value="external reference" data-track-label="10.1016/j.ijadhadh.2021.102861">https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijadhadh.2021.102861</a></p><p class="c-article-references__links u-hide-print"><a data-track="click_references" rel="nofollow noopener" data-track-label="10.1016/j.ijadhadh.2021.102861" data-track-item_id="10.1016/j.ijadhadh.2021.102861" data-track-value="article reference" data-track-action="article reference" href="https://doi.org/10.1016%2Fj.ijadhadh.2021.102861" aria-label="Article reference 7" data-doi="10.1016/j.ijadhadh.2021.102861">Article</a> 
